  "status": "stable",
  "added": "2026-04-19",
  "notes": "PROV's invalidation pointer — the inverse-in-time of `prov:wasGeneratedBy`. Records that an Entity ceased to exist at a particular Activity. Pair with `prov:invalidatedAtTime` for the timestamp. In ActivityStreams, a deleted object is typically replaced by an `as:Tombstone` and the deletion recorded as an `as:Delete` activity.",
